EXCEPTION_WHAT: vector::_M_range_check: __n (which is 99) >= this->size() (which is 3)

// std::runtime_error thrown by application code
EXCEPTION_WHAT: Config key 'x' not found. Searched: /etc/app/prod.conf, /var/secrets/app.env

// std::invalid_argument from std::stoi
EXCEPTION_WHAT: stoi

```

